<title>UK: Allgemeine Hypo prices 1.0 bln mark pfandbrief.</title>
<headline>Allgemeine Hypo prices 1.0 bln mark pfandbrief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced by joint lead managers ABN Amro Hoare Govett, Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, DG Bank and Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLGEMEINE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     3.25	MATURITY    02.JUL.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.165    PAY DATE    10.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  12.5 BP   REOFFER    99.08     SPREAD	+FLAT</p>
<p> MGT/UND    4 BP	SELL CONC  8.5 BP    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.375 PCT JULY 1999 TREUHAND</p>
<p> NOTES	OFFETLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 478</p>
<p>		INCREASE TO EARLIER 1.0 BLN MARK ISSUE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
